    <string name="info_title">Tips</string>
    <string name="info_body">• Hold the phone with the speaker facing down so gravity helps.\n• Take off the case and keep the volume at max.\n• If the sound is still muffled, repeat 2–3 times.\n• If the wet phone thinks headphones are plugged in, keep \"Force speaker\" on: the sound still comes out of the speaker.\n• This only clears water from the speaker grille. It does not dry the charging port: do not charge until it is fully dry.\n• It can be very loud. Do not hold the phone to your ear while it plays.</string>

